ability and decision speed are strong. So we keep recommendation C.\n\nWe need to reference James's answer about D's technical competence and decision quality, and also earlier notes about D's arrogance, weak leadership, and unknown crew cooperation. Also mention that C's strengths still outweigh D's.\n\nThus produce public message: I remain with C, because D's technical competence is good but decision quality unknown, and crew cooperation concerns due to arrogance, plus weak leadership, while C has proven reliability and decision speed.\n\nNow produce METADATA_JSON with vote Candidate C."}
